issues.suggestion:
Add a SHACL constraint that enforces equality of the two properties, e.g.:
```
sh:property [
  sh:path nltl:ruleLength ;
  sh:equals nltl:classificationSocietyRuleLength ;
] .
```
This ensures that any ship instance must have the same numeric value (and unit) for both ruleLength and classificationSocietyRuleLength.
